    - target: {fileID: 1667254067275592892, guid: 70681ebd26fe0fb4b8974c8b384fc7de,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLines.Array.data[0]
      value: Akhirnya kamu datang mengunjungi kakek , kakek sangat rindu sekali.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1667254067275592892, guid: 70681ebd26fe0fb4b8974c8b384fc7de,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLines.Array.data[1]
      value: Apakah kamu merasa bernostalgia datang kesini?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1667254067275592892, guid: 70681ebd26fe0fb4b8974c8b384fc7de,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLines.Array.data[2]
      value: Kakek akan memasak makanan untuk kita makan terlebih dahulu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1667254067275592892, guid: 70681ebd26fe0fb4b8974c8b384fc7de,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLines.Array.data[3]
      value: 'Tidak perlu repot-repot, bagaimana kalau kamu pergi memancing selagi
        menunggu kakek untuk memasak? '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1667254067275592892, guid: 70681ebd26fe0fb4b8974c8b384fc7de,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLines.Array.data[4]
      value: Kamu pasti merindukan suasana laut.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1667254067275592892, guid: 70681ebd26fe0fb4b8974c8b384fc7de,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: respondLines.Array.data[0]
      value: Aku juga kek, senang bisa bertemu kakek lagi.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1667254067275592892, guid: 70681ebd26fe0fb4b8974c8b384fc7de,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: respondLines.Array.data[1]
      value: Iya, aku merindukan suasana di sini.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1667254067275592892, guid: 70681ebd26fe0fb4b8974c8b384fc7de,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: respondLines.Array.data[2]
      value: Apakah aku bisa membantu mu?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1667254067275592892, guid: 70681ebd26fe0fb4b8974c8b384fc7de,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: respondLines.Array.data[3]
      value: Benar juga.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1667254067275592892, guid: 70681ebd26fe0fb4b8974c8b384fc7de,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: respondLines.Array.data[4]
